  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the displacement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> of the body, it can be written that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></math></p><p>And, for the displacement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> of the body, it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mrow><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> be the required time, it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equations (1), (2) and (3) imply that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><msup><mi>p</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>"
  }
